Answer from
Manohar Mulchandani:

Replace the loop in your email with the code below - I tested it and the error was gone. You may also want to check out the server.R file at this link, which is what I referred to for this: https://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/creating-a-ui-from-a-loop.html

    status_list<-lapply(1:nrow(arts), function(i) {input[[paste0('Art',i)]]})

    for (i in 1:nrow(arts)) {
      if (status_list[[i]] == "Passed") {

        arts$Status[i]="Passed"
        arts$Use.P[i]<-0
      }

      else if (status_list[[i]] == "Passed") {

        arts$Status[i]="Rejected"
        arts$Use.P[i]<-0
        arts$Use.R[i]<-1
      }
    }

